WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.797
A role title is not a grant of authority

00:00:03.731 --> 00:00:08.246
Role titles vary and can overlap An EA PA

00:00:08.548 --> 00:00:12.311
office manager chief of staff and specialist adviser may

00:00:12.377 --> 00:00:15.746
work closely but proximity to an executive does not

00:00:15.798 --> 00:00:21.627
transfer another role’s mandate Production judgement and coordination are

00:00:21.706 --> 00:00:26.719
connected contributions not ranks Compare what each role has

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:29.430
actually been appointed to do before deciding where a

00:00:29.509 --> 00:00:34.877
request belongs Compare responsibilities and identify the appointed owner

00:00:34.903 --> 00:00:37.219
for a task that goes beyond Daniel’s role
